Usage ID,Email ID,Email Name,Email State,Email Type,Email Source,Email Reference URL,Email Version,Draft Or Live,Template Path,Module File ID,Module Family ID,Module Family,Module Path,HubSpot Module ID,Widget ID,Widget Name,Widget Type,Widget Order,Section ID,Section Index,Column Index,Widget Index,Presentation Mode,Field Values JSON,Field Values Hash,Has Full Wrapper,Is Bare Widget,Detected From JSON At,Relationship Type,Relationship Status,Notes
usage_207107135814_module_0_0_0_0,207107135814,VIP-01-Personal-Founder-Outreach,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\""UTF-8\"">\n<style>\nbody { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }\np { margin: 0 0 16px 0; }\n.container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }\n.signature { color: #2D6A4F; font-weight: bold; }\na { color: #2D6A4F; text-decoration: underline; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\""container\"">\n\n<p>Hi {{contact.firstname}},</p>\n\n<p>I'm going to be direct with you — we had a rough year in 2025. If you ordered from us as OneHead Hair Solutions, you experienced it firsthand: orders delayed, poor communication, a couple of chargebacks. That was on me.</p>\n\n<p>I want to explain what happened and what's changed.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Problem:</strong> We scaled too fast without the infrastructure to back it up. Our supplier couldn't keep pace. We lost track of orders. Our communication was scattered. You deserved better, and we let you down.</p>\n\n<p><strong>What's Different Now:</strong> We rebuilt from the ground up. New suppliers. New production partners. A tracking system where I personally review every order before it ships. We're now Hair Solutions Co. — smaller, more focused, and completely transparent about where your order is at every stage.</p>\n\n<p>Here's my personal commitment to you: When you order from us, I'm watching it. You'll get tracking updates. You'll get a preparation guide before delivery. If anything goes wrong, you reach me directly — not a chatbot.</p>\n\n<p>I know trust isn't rebuilt with words. It's rebuilt with results. That's why I'm inviting you back, no pressure, just to see what we've built.</p>\n\n<p>I appreciate you giving us a second chance.</p>\n\n<p>—Vincent<br>\n<span class=\""signature\"">Founder, Hair Solutions Co.</span></p>\n\n<table width=\""100%\"" border=\""0\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding: 20px 0;\"">\n      <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=vip-reengagement&utm_content=vip-01-personal-outreach&utm_term=main-cta\"" style=\""background-color: #2D6A4F; color: white; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;\"">Visit Hair Solutions Co.</a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<p style=\""text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\""><a href=\""mailto:vincent@hairsolutions.co\"" style=\""color: #2D6A4F; text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14px;\"">Reply to This Email — I Read Them Personally</a></p>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"",""lineNumber"":32,""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":19}",8ecfe4403e246332de6e22258ae2ff78a39fccf8603985a815f0e8659637f5ad,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_207107135814_module_1_0_0_1,207107135814,VIP-01-Personal-Founder-Outreach,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""font"":{""color"":""{{is_ungated_for_email_branded_templates && style_settings.initial_source == \""BRANDED_TEMPLATE\"" ? style_settings.primary_font_color : \""#23496d\""}}"",""font"":""Arial, sans-serif"",""size"":{""units"":""px"",""value"":12}},""lineNumber"":61,""link_font"":{""color"":""{{is_ungated_for_email_branded_templates && style_settings.initial_source == \""BRANDED_TEMPLATE\"" ? style_settings.primary_font_color : \""#00a4bd\""}}"",""font"":""Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif"",""size"":{""units"":""px"",""value"":12},""styles"":{""bold"":false,""italic"":false,""underline"":true}},""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-973,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",1308b335f0e023a29469126e487a69541697de9958fbf8c8897a72940cf6208d,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_207107135817_module_0_0_0_0,207107135817,VIP-02-Value-Reminder-Product-Match,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\""UTF-8\"">\n<style>\nbody { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }\np { margin: 0 0 16px 0; }\n.container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }\n.product-box { background: #f5f5f5; padding: 16px; margin: 16px 0; border-left: 4px solid #2D6A4F; }\n.product-name { font-weight: bold; color: #2D6A4F; }\n.gold-accent { color: #D4A574; font-weight: bold; }\na { color: #2D6A4F; text-decoration: underline; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\""container\"">\n\n<p>Hi {{contact.firstname}},</p>\n\n<p>You chose {{contact.product_preference}} for a reason. They work. The confidence you felt, the fit, the natural look — that's why you came to us in the first place.</p>\n\n<p>We've actually upgraded a few things since you last shopped with us, and I wanted to show you what's new.</p>\n\n<div class=\""product-box\"">\n<p><strong class=\""product-name\"">Premium Lace Collection</strong><br>\nIf you went with lace before, we now have a <span class=\""gold-accent\"">thinner, stronger</span> lace material with better color matching. It's a noticeable difference in breathability.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\""product-box\"">\n<p><strong class=\""product-name\"">Hybrid Base Systems</strong><br>\nThis is newer — combines the comfort of lace with the durability of poly. Most customers now tell us this is their sweet spot.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\""product-box\"">\n<p><strong class=\""product-name\"">Maintenance Kits</strong><br>\nWe've simplified the care routine and created bundles so everything you need comes with your order. No guessing, no extra costs.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>Want to see if any of these are a better fit than what you had before? No pressure — I know what worked for you worked.</p>\n\n<p>—Vincent</p>\n\n<table width=\""100%\"" border=\""0\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding: 20px 0;\"">\n      <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/collections/all?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=vip-reengagement&utm_content=vip-02-value-reminder&utm_term=main-cta\"" style=\""background-color: #2D6A4F; color: white; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;\"">Shop Hair Systems</a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<p style=\""text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\""><a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/pages/contact?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=vip-reengagement&utm_content=vip-02-value-reminder&utm_term=secondary-cta\"" style=\""color: #2D6A4F; text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14px;\"">Need Help Choosing? Message Me</a></p>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"",""schema_version"":2}",9149b3e096d9513cf409442443f11fd4fb5da256c19be49b5cadc7f334c8cd89,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_207107135817_module_1_0_0_1,207107135817,VIP-02-Value-Reminder-Product-Match,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_207107135820_module_0_0_0_0,207107135820,VIP-03-Social-Proof-New-Testimonials,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\""UTF-8\"">\n<style>\nbody { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }\np { margin: 0 0 16px 0; }\n.container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }\n.testimonial { background: #f9f9f9; padding: 16px; margin: 16px 0; border-left: 4px solid #D4A574; font-style: italic; color: #555; }\n.author { font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; color: #2D6A4F; margin-top: 8px; }\n.improvement-box { background: #f5f5f5; padding: 12px; margin: 12px 0; border-radius: 4px; }\n.improvement-title { color: #2D6A4F; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; }\na { color: #2D6A4F; text-decoration: underline; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\""container\"">\n\n<p>Hi {{contact.firstname}},</p>\n\n<p>We've gotten a lot of messages from customers since we relaunched as Hair Solutions Co. Here's what they're telling us:</p>\n\n<div class=\""testimonial\"">\n<p>\""Ordered in January, received tracking updates within 24 hours, and it arrived in 10 days. Real communication this time. I'm actually coming back.\""</p>\n<p class=\""author\"">— Marcus T., Toronto</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\""testimonial\"">\n<p>\""The new systems fit better. And honestly, the care guide that came with it made everything so much simpler. I'm not spending 30 minutes on maintenance anymore.\""</p>\n<p class=\""author\"">— David K., Vancouver</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\""testimonial\"">\n<p>\""I was skeptical after my first experience. But Vincent's personal note convinced me to try again. Best decision — product quality and customer service are night and day.\""</p>\n<p class=\""author\"">— James M., Calgary</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>What's actually changed behind the scenes:</p>\n\n<div class=\""improvement-box\"">\n<p class=\""improvement-title\"">✓ Real-Time Tracking</p>\n<p style=\""margin: 4px 0; font-size: 14px;\"">Every order gets a tracking number within 24 hours. You know exactly where it is.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\""improvement-box\"">\n<p class=\""improvement-title\"">✓ Personal Oversight</p>\n<p style=\""margin: 4px 0; font-size: 14px;\"">I review every order before it ships. No order leaves without my approval.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\""improvement-box\"">\n<p class=\""improvement-title\"">✓ Faster Production</p>\n<p style=\""margin: 4px 0; font-size: 14px;\"">Average 7-10 business days from order to ship. No hidden delays.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>These aren't just promises. They're what our customers are experiencing right now.</p>\n\n<p>—Vincent</p>\n\n<table width=\""100%\"" border=\""0\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding: 20px 0;\"">\n      <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/pages/testimonials?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=vip-reengagement&utm_content=vip-03-social-proof&utm_term=main-cta\"" style=\""background-color: #2D6A4F; color: white; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;\"">See Customer Stories</a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<p style=\""text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\""><a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/pages/contact?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=vip-reengagement&utm_content=vip-03-social-proof&utm_term=secondary-cta\"" style=\""color: #2D6A4F; text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14px;\"">Share Your Story</a></p>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"",""schema_version"":2}",4394e0c5cc9357dda67685c343343562b6415632bf8176335999e2e9cf97eadb,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_207107135820_module_1_0_0_1,207107135820,VIP-03-Social-Proof-New-Testimonials,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_207110364254_module_0_0_0_0,207110364254,VIP-04-Exclusive-Offer-Welcome-Back,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\""UTF-8\"">\n<style>\nbody { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }\np { margin: 0 0 16px 0; }\n.container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }\n.offer-box { background: #2D6A4F; color: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 4px; text-align: center; margin: 20px 0; }\n.discount-amount { font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; margin: 10px 0; }\n.code-box { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding: 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: monospace; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin: 10px 0; letter-spacing: 2px; }\n.benefit { background: #f5f5f5; padding: 12px; margin: 10px 0; border-left: 4px solid #D4A574; }\n.benefit-title { color: #2D6A4F; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; }\n.expiration { color: #d9534f; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 16px; }\na { color: #2D6A4F; text-decoration: underline; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\""container\"">\n\n<p>Hi {{contact.firstname}},</p>\n\n<p>You've given us a chance to prove ourselves. Now we want to make it worth your while.</p>\n\n<div class=\""offer-box\"">\n<p style=\""margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px;\"">VIP WELCOME-BACK OFFER</p>\n<div class=\""discount-amount\"">15% Off</div>\n<p style=\""margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px;\"">Use code at checkout</p>\n<div class=\""code-box\"">COMEBACK15</div>\n</div>\n\n<p><strong>This exclusive offer includes:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\""benefit\"">\n<p class=\""benefit-title\"">15% Discount on Your Order</p>\n<p style=\""margin: 4px 0; font-size: 14px;\"">Applied at checkout with code COMEBACK15.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\""benefit\"">\n<p class=\""benefit-title\"">Free Maintenance Starter Kit</p>\n<p style=\""margin: 4px 0; font-size: 14px;\"">Everything you need to keep your system looking brand new — normally $45, it's yours free.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\""benefit\"">\n<p class=\""benefit-title\"">Priority Production Scheduling</p>\n<p style=\""margin: 4px 0; font-size: 14px;\"">Your order goes to the front of the queue. 5-7 business days, not 10.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>Here's what happens next: Order gets confirmed. I personally review it. Your kit ships with a detailed preparation guide. Tracking updates along the way. When it arrives, you'll know exactly how to get started.</p>\n\n<p>No surprises. No hidden timeline. Just the service you deserved from the beginning.</p>\n\n<p class=\""expiration\"">This offer expires in 14 days. {{contact.firstname}}, this is VIP-only.</p>\n\n<p>—Vincent</p>\n\n<table width=\""100%\"" border=\""0\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding: 20px 0;\"">\n      <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/collections/all?discount=COMEBACK15&utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=vip-reengagement&utm_content=vip-04-exclusive-offer&utm_term=main-cta\"" style=\""background-color: #2D6A4F; color: white; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;\"">Redeem Your 15% Off</a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<p style=\""text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\""><a href=\""mailto:vincent@hairsolutions.co?subject=VIP%20Offer%20Question&utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=vip-reengagement&utm_content=vip-04-exclusive-offer&utm_term=secondary-cta\"" style=\""color: #2D6A4F; text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14px;\"">Questions About This Offer? Email Me</a></p>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"",""schema_version"":2}",76d5c32842cea2aa66626e134ee05924d7ea2ba19bfb19207963ded303c8dc27,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_207110364254_module_1_0_0_1,207110364254,VIP-04-Exclusive-Offer-Welcome-Back,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_207110364257_module_0_0_0_0,207110364257,WELCOME-01-New-Subscriber-Introduction,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<table width=\""100%\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;\"">\n  <tr><td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding:32px 16px;\"">\n    <table width=\""580\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""max-width:580px;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\"">\n\n      <!-- HEADER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#1a1a1a;padding:28px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <span style=\""color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;\"">Hair Solutions Co.</span>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- BODY -->\n      <tr><td style=\""padding:40px;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"">\n        <h2 style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;margin:0 0 20px;color:#1a1a1a;\"">Hi {{ contact.firstname | default(\""there\"") }},</h2>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Welcome to Hair Solutions Co. — we’re glad you’re here.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">I’m Vincent, one of the founders. We help people regain confidence with high-quality, custom hair replacement systems — hand-made, fitted to your measurements, and designed to look completely natural.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Over the next few emails, we’ll share a bit about how everything works, what to expect, and how to get started if you’re ready. No pressure, no hard sell — just useful information.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">If you have any questions in the meantime, just reply to this email. A real person reads every message.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">&mdash; Vincent<br>Hair Solutions Co.</p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- FOOTER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.5;\"">Hair Solutions Co. &bull; <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co\"" style=\""color:#999999;text-decoration:none;\"">hairsolutions.co</a></p>\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"">\n          <a href=\""{{ unsubscribe_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Unsubscribe</a> &bull;\n          <a href=\""{{ subscription_preferences_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Manage preferences</a>\n        </p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>"",""lineNumber"":32,""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":19}",45596cbb6f7a82d85e196f37305c653f56e4ab186efdbf1fb539e1e2eb334104,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_207110364257_module_1_0_0_1,207110364257,WELCOME-01-New-Subscriber-Introduction,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""font"":{""color"":""{{is_ungated_for_email_branded_templates && style_settings.initial_source == \""BRANDED_TEMPLATE\"" ? style_settings.primary_font_color : \""#23496d\""}}"",""font"":""Arial, sans-serif"",""size"":{""units"":""px"",""value"":12}},""lineNumber"":61,""link_font"":{""color"":""{{is_ungated_for_email_branded_templates && style_settings.initial_source == \""BRANDED_TEMPLATE\"" ? style_settings.primary_font_color : \""#00a4bd\""}}"",""font"":""Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif"",""size"":{""units"":""px"",""value"":12},""styles"":{""bold"":false,""italic"":false,""underline"":true}},""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-973,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",1308b335f0e023a29469126e487a69541697de9958fbf8c8897a72940cf6208d,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_207224277892_module_0_0_0_0,207224277892,J3-E1 — Your order is confirmed — here's what's next,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<table width=\""100%\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;\"">\n  <tr><td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding: 32px 0;\"">\n    <table width=\""580\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""max-width:580px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:4px; overflow:hidden;\"">\n      <!-- HEADER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#1a1a1a; padding:28px 40px; text-align:center;\"">\n        <span style=\""color:#ffffff; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase;\"">Hair Solutions Co.</span>\n      </td></tr>\n      <!-- BODY -->\n      <tr><td style=\""padding:40px; color:#1a1a1a; font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"">\n        <h2 style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:bold; margin:0 0 20px; color:#1a1a1a;\"">Your order is confirmed, {{ contact.firstname | default(\""there\"") }}.</h2>\n        <p style=\""font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 18px; color:#333333;\"">We&rsquo;ve received your order and it&rsquo;s now in the hands of our production team. Here&rsquo;s a quick overview of what happens from here:</p>\n        <ul style=\""padding-left:20px; margin:0 0 18px;\"">\n          <li style=\""font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; color:#333333; margin-bottom:8px;\""><strong>Days 1&ndash;3:</strong> Your order is reviewed and matched to the correct specification.</li>\n          <li style=\""font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; color:#333333; margin-bottom:8px;\""><strong>Days 4&ndash;14:</strong> Production and quality inspection.</li>\n          <li style=\""font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; color:#333333; margin-bottom:8px;\""><strong>Days 15&ndash;18:</strong> Shipping preparation and dispatch. You&rsquo;ll receive a tracking link as soon as your system is in transit.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p style=\""font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 18px; color:#333333;\"">We&rsquo;ll be in touch at each stage. If you have any questions before your system arrives, just reply to this email &mdash; it goes straight to a real person.</p>\n        <hr style=\""border:none; border-top:1px solid #eeebe6; margin:28px 0;\"">\n        <p style=\""font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 18px; color:#333333;\"">Thank you for trusting us with this. We take it seriously.</p>\n        <p style=\""font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; margin:0; color:#333333;\"">&mdash; The Hair Solutions Co. team</p>\n      </td></tr>\n      <!-- FOOTER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4; padding:24px 40px; text-align:center;\"">\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:#999999; margin:0 0 6px; line-height:1.5;\"">Hair Solutions Co. &bull; hairsolutions.co</p>\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:#999999; margin:0 0 6px; line-height:1.5;\""><a href=\""{{ unsubscribe_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Unsubscribe</a> &bull; <a href=\""{{ subscription_preferences_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Manage preferences</a></p>\n      </td></tr>\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>"",""schema_version"":2}",e9ee21c859f5c1219c8462c866e843105bfbd35fe9acf173840f8f549533b72e,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_207224277892_module_1_0_0_1,207224277892,J3-E1 — Your order is confirmed — here's what's next,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_207224311662_module_0_0_0_0,207224311662,J3-E4 — Did your system arrive safely?,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<table width=\""100%\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;\"">\n  <tr><td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding:32px 16px;\"">\n    <table width=\""580\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""max-width:580px;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\"">\n\n      <!-- HEADER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#1a1a1a;padding:28px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <span style=\""color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;\"">Hair Solutions Co.</span>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- BODY -->\n      <tr><td style=\""padding:40px;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"">\n        <h2 style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;margin:0 0 20px;color:#1a1a1a;\"">Just checking in, {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }}.</h2>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Your system should have arrived by now. We wanted to check in and make sure everything looks good.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\""><strong>When you open the box:</strong></p>\n<ul style=\""padding-left:20px;margin:0 0 18px;\""><li style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#333333;margin-bottom:8px;\"">The system may have a slight factory scent — this is normal and will dissipate.</li><li style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#333333;margin-bottom:8px;\"">Inspect the base and edges before handling. If anything looks unexpected, take a photo and reply to this email.</li><li style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#333333;margin-bottom:8px;\"">Don’t stretch or pull the base until you’re ready to apply — let it settle at room temperature first.</li></ul>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">If something doesn’t look right, or if your package hasn’t arrived, please reply here and we’ll sort it out immediately.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">We’re excited for you. This is the start of something good.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">&mdash; Hair Solutions Co.</p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- FOOTER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.5;\"">Hair Solutions Co. &bull; <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co\"" style=\""color:#999999;text-decoration:none;\"">hairsolutions.co</a></p>\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"">\n          <a href=\""{{ unsubscribe_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Unsubscribe</a> &bull;\n          <a href=\""{{ subscription_preferences_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Manage preferences</a>\n        </p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>"",""schema_version"":2}",8c73ccd71084a6c77d38f21a1bd2b00b1eb9559a20d50a7c0e1b5fa3a202d05b,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_207224311662_module_1_0_0_1,207224311662,J3-E4 — Did your system arrive safely?,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_208939236631_module_0_0_0_0,208939236631,J3-E3 — Your hair system is on the way,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<table width=\""100%\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;\"">\n  <tr><td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding:32px 16px;\"">\n    <table width=\""580\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""max-width:580px;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\"">\n\n      <!-- HEADER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#1a1a1a;padding:28px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <span style=\""color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;\"">Hair Solutions Co.</span>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- BODY -->\n      <tr><td style=\""padding:40px;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"">\n        <h2 style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;margin:0 0 20px;color:#1a1a1a;\"">It’s on the way, {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }}.</h2>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Your hair system has been shipped and is now in transit. Depending on your location, delivery typically takes 3–7 business days from this point.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Your tracking information will be sent separately from our shipping partner. Keep an eye on your inbox (and your spam folder, just in case).</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\""><strong>A few things to do while you wait:</strong></p>\n<ul style=\""padding-left:20px;margin:0 0 18px;\""><li style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#333333;margin-bottom:8px;\"">Make sure someone is available to receive the package — avoid leaving it in direct heat or sunlight.</li><li style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#333333;margin-bottom:8px;\"">Have a flat surface ready for unboxing. Take your time — there’s no rush.</li><li style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#333333;margin-bottom:8px;\"">We’ll send you a quick check-in once your expected delivery date passes, just to make sure everything arrived in good shape.</li></ul>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Any questions before it arrives? Reply here — we’re around.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">&mdash; Hair Solutions Co.</p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- FOOTER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.5;\"">Hair Solutions Co. &bull; <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co\"" style=\""color:#999999;text-decoration:none;\"">hairsolutions.co</a></p>\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"">\n          <a href=\""{{ unsubscribe_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Unsubscribe</a> &bull;\n          <a href=\""{{ subscription_preferences_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Manage preferences</a>\n        </p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>"",""schema_version"":2}",e4dc3e59785e9730451282df8bf338cc22ec6a4fca10ae96c61fd3bcdefb56ef,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_208939236631_module_1_0_0_1,208939236631,J3-E3 — Your hair system is on the way,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_211278031920_module_0_0_0_0,211278031920,J1-E1 — Welcome to Hair Solutions Co.,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<table width=\""100%\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;\"">\n  <tr><td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding:32px 16px;\"">\n    <table width=\""580\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""max-width:580px;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\"">\n\n      <!-- HEADER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#1a1a1a;padding:28px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <span style=\""color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;\"">Hair Solutions Co.</span>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- BODY -->\n      <tr><td style=\""padding:40px;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"">\n        <h2 style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;margin:0 0 20px;color:#1a1a1a;\"">Welcome, {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }}.</h2>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Thank you for reaching out. We’re glad you’re here.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Below you’ll find the resources we mentioned — put together by our team to give you a clear, honest picture of what hair replacement systems actually involve.</p>\n<ul style=\""padding-left:20px;margin:0 0 18px;\""><li style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#333333;margin-bottom:8px;\""><a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/pages/how-it-works\"" style=\""color:#c8a96e;\"">How hair systems work</a> — a plain-language overview of bases, hair types, and attachment methods</li><li style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#333333;margin-bottom:8px;\""><a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/pages/faq\"" style=\""color:#c8a96e;\"">Common questions answered</a> — the questions most people have before their first order</li><li style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#333333;margin-bottom:8px;\""><a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/pages/gallery\"" style=\""color:#c8a96e;\"">Real results</a> — photos from our clients (with permission)</li></ul>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Over the next few days, we’ll share a bit more about who we are and how we work. Nothing overwhelming — just the information that helps people make a confident decision.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">If you have a question right now, reply here. We read every message.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">&mdash; The Hair Solutions Co. team</p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- FOOTER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.5;\"">Hair Solutions Co. &bull; <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co\"" style=\""color:#999999;text-decoration:none;\"">hairsolutions.co</a></p>\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"">\n          <a href=\""{{ unsubscribe_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Unsubscribe</a> &bull;\n          <a href=\""{{ subscription_preferences_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Manage preferences</a>\n        </p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>"",""schema_version"":2}",4157455cadd1c4dbd15aa3fd8c0f4b3d707a48b5e1389599169443d337f8af3d,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
