usage_211345977476_module_0_0_0_0,211345977476,J7-E4 — Last email from us — we respect your inbox,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<table width=\""100%\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;\"">\n  <tr><td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding:32px 16px;\"">\n    <table width=\""580\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""max-width:580px;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\"">\n\n      <!-- HEADER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#1a1a1a;padding:28px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <span style=\""color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;\"">Hair Solutions Co.</span>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- BODY -->\n      <tr><td style=\""padding:40px;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"">\n        <h2 style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;margin:0 0 20px;color:#1a1a1a;\"">This is our last email, {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }}.</h2>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">We’ve sent a few messages over the past weeks, and we don’t want to add to the noise if this isn’t the right time for you.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">So this is the last one — unless you reach out or re-subscribe.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">If your situation changes and you want to reconnect, we’re here. You can always reach us directly at <a href=\""mailto:hello@hairsolutions.co\"" style=\""color:#c8a96e;\"">hello@hairsolutions.co</a> or visit us at <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co\"" style=\""color:#c8a96e;\"">hairsolutions.co</a>.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Thank you for being part of the Hair Solutions Co. community, however brief. We genuinely wish you well.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">&mdash; The Hair Solutions Co. team</p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- FOOTER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.5;\"">Hair Solutions Co. &bull; <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co\"" style=\""color:#999999;text-decoration:none;\"">hairsolutions.co</a></p>\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"">\n          <a href=\""{{ unsubscribe_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Unsubscribe</a> &bull;\n          <a href=\""{{ subscription_preferences_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Manage preferences</a>\n        </p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>"",""schema_version"":2}",66cb6ad00c29c4fbbe427356a09dd185d201d41edcf0c5a8ba25dbfc6be5a8d8,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_211345977476_module_1_0_0_1,211345977476,J7-E4 — Last email from us — we respect your inbox,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_211345979187_module_0_0_0_0,211345979187,J1-E2 — Why we do this (and why it matters to you),AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<table width=\""100%\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;\"">\n  <tr><td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding:32px 16px;\"">\n    <table width=\""580\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""max-width:580px;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\"">\n\n      <!-- HEADER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#1a1a1a;padding:28px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <span style=\""color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;\"">Hair Solutions Co.</span>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- BODY -->\n      <tr><td style=\""padding:40px;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"">\n        <h2 style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;margin:0 0 20px;color:#1a1a1a;\"">A bit about us, {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }}.</h2>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Hair Solutions Co. was built on a simple observation: most people exploring hair replacement systems feel confused, overwhelmed, or misled before they even place a first order.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">The information is scattered. The terminology is inconsistent. And the stakes feel high — because they are. This is something you wear every day.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">We started with the conviction that this should be simpler, more transparent, and more personal. We’re a small team, and we deal directly with every client. No call centers, no scripts, no upsell pressure.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Our systems are built to a high standard because we believe you deserve to forget you’re wearing one. When a system is truly well-made and well-fitted, it stops being a thing you manage and becomes simply part of how you look.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">That’s what we’re working toward with every order.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Tomorrow, we’ll talk about the different base types and how to think about which one is right for you.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">&mdash; The Hair Solutions Co. team</p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- FOOTER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.5;\"">Hair Solutions Co. &bull; <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co\"" style=\""color:#999999;text-decoration:none;\"">hairsolutions.co</a></p>\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"">\n          <a href=\""{{ unsubscribe_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Unsubscribe</a> &bull;\n          <a href=\""{{ subscription_preferences_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Manage preferences</a>\n        </p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>"",""schema_version"":2}",728ade53a7d6bc5cf45d918d815b5ed968fb9defa0e0e008279a192418f69374,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_211345979187_module_1_0_0_1,211345979187,J1-E2 — Why we do this (and why it matters to you),AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_211345979193_module_0_0_0_0,211345979193,J1-E5 — Ready to talk? Book your free consultation,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<table width=\""100%\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;\"">\n  <tr><td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding:32px 16px;\"">\n    <table width=\""580\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""max-width:580px;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\"">\n\n      <!-- HEADER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#1a1a1a;padding:28px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <span style=\""color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;\"">Hair Solutions Co.</span>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- BODY -->\n      <tr><td style=\""padding:40px;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"">\n        <h2 style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;margin:0 0 20px;color:#1a1a1a;\"">When you’re ready, we’re ready, {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }}.</h2>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Over the past week or so, you’ve gotten a sense of who we are and how we work. If you’re still curious — or if you have specific questions about whether a hair system is right for your situation — this is the moment to talk.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">A consultation with us is a real conversation, not a sales call. We’ll listen to what you’re looking for, answer your questions honestly, and only suggest moving forward if it genuinely makes sense for you.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">There’s no fee and no obligation.</p>\n<table width=\""100%\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""margin:32px 0;\"">\n  <tr><td align=\""center\"">\n    <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/pages/consultation\"" style=\""display:inline-block;background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:2px;\"">Book your free consultation</a>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">If you’d rather keep reading and thinking, that’s completely fine too. We’ll continue sending occasional updates — nothing overwhelming.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">&mdash; Hair Solutions Co.</p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- FOOTER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.5;\"">Hair Solutions Co. &bull; <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co\"" style=\""color:#999999;text-decoration:none;\"">hairsolutions.co</a></p>\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"">\n          <a href=\""{{ unsubscribe_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Unsubscribe</a> &bull;\n          <a href=\""{{ subscription_preferences_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Manage preferences</a>\n        </p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>"",""schema_version"":2}",0f3eb99552e36b99dfb7bc8e41dd4ecb5dea7dc7e1304cedfe32d95dbd43e5dd,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_211345979193_module_1_0_0_1,211345979193,J1-E5 — Ready to talk? Book your free consultation,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_211345979651_module_0_0_0_0,211345979651,J3-E5 — Week 1 care tips for your hair system,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<table width=\""100%\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;\"">\n  <tr><td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding:32px 16px;\"">\n    <table width=\""580\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""max-width:580px;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\"">\n\n      <!-- HEADER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#1a1a1a;padding:28px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <span style=\""color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;\"">Hair Solutions Co.</span>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- BODY -->\n      <tr><td style=\""padding:40px;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"">\n        <h2 style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;margin:0 0 20px;color:#1a1a1a;\"">Week 1: getting acquainted.</h2>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Hi {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }}, your first week with a hair system is mostly about observation. You’re learning how it feels, how it moves, and how your scalp responds.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\""><strong>Focus on these three things this week:</strong></p>\n<ul style=\""padding-left:20px;margin:0 0 18px;\""><li style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#333333;margin-bottom:8px;\""><strong>Bonding:</strong> Don’t wash or wet the system in the first 24–48 hours after application. This gives the adhesive time to cure properly.</li><li style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#333333;margin-bottom:8px;\""><strong>Scalp care:</strong> Keep the perimeter clean and dry. If you feel any irritation, let it breathe — don’t re-apply adhesive on irritated skin.</li><li style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#333333;margin-bottom:8px;\""><strong>Hair care:</strong> Use a gentle, sulfate-free shampoo when you first wash. Avoid heat styling on high settings until you’ve tested how the hair responds.</li></ul>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Most first-week questions come down to adhesive and washing. If you’re unsure about anything, reply and ask. No question is too basic.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">&mdash; Hair Solutions Co.</p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- FOOTER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.5;\"">Hair Solutions Co. &bull; <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co\"" style=\""color:#999999;text-decoration:none;\"">hairsolutions.co</a></p>\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"">\n          <a href=\""{{ unsubscribe_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Unsubscribe</a> &bull;\n          <a href=\""{{ subscription_preferences_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Manage preferences</a>\n        </p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>"",""schema_version"":2}",760443290da9c75c846213ad5470f98344bfb5ba713fda87f0d07f0971391e78,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_211345979651_module_1_0_0_1,211345979651,J3-E5 — Week 1 care tips for your hair system,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_211345979661_module_0_0_0_0,211345979661,J1-E4 — Real results from real customers,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<table width=\""100%\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;\"">\n  <tr><td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding:32px 16px;\"">\n    <table width=\""580\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""max-width:580px;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\"">\n\n      <!-- HEADER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#1a1a1a;padding:28px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <span style=\""color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;\"">Hair Solutions Co.</span>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- BODY -->\n      <tr><td style=\""padding:40px;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"">\n        <h2 style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;margin:0 0 20px;color:#1a1a1a;\"">What our clients say, {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }}.</h2>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">We’re careful about how we talk about results. Hair systems are not one-size-fits-all, and what looks remarkable on one person depends on their hair type, scalp, and how they wear and care for their system.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">That said, we want to share a few things we hear consistently from long-term clients:</p>\n<ul style=\""padding-left:20px;margin:0 0 18px;\""><li style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#333333;margin-bottom:8px;\""><em>“I forgot I was wearing it within the first two weeks.”</em></li><li style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#333333;margin-bottom:8px;\""><em>“The quality is noticeably different from what I tried before. The hair moves naturally.”</em></li><li style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#333333;margin-bottom:8px;\""><em>“I was nervous about the process, but the team walked me through everything. It was easier than I expected.”</em></li><li style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#333333;margin-bottom:8px;\""><em>“I’ve ordered three times now. Each one has been better because they actually remember my preferences.”</em></li></ul>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">These are the outcomes we aim for. Not a transformation, but a system that works so well it becomes invisible — even to you.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Next up: an invitation to talk with us directly, if you’re ready.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">&mdash; Hair Solutions Co.</p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- FOOTER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.5;\"">Hair Solutions Co. &bull; <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co\"" style=\""color:#999999;text-decoration:none;\"">hairsolutions.co</a></p>\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"">\n          <a href=\""{{ unsubscribe_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Unsubscribe</a> &bull;\n          <a href=\""{{ subscription_preferences_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Manage preferences</a>\n        </p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>"",""schema_version"":2}",244941b08e8d8cd961a81686efaf484dbd4c4e33c1ed1bb25c0467fc078bd4a4,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_211345979661_module_1_0_0_1,211345979661,J1-E4 — Real results from real customers,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_211345979664_module_0_0_0_0,211345979664,J7-E1 — Just checking in — Vincent here,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,1,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<table width=\""100%\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;\"">\n  <tr><td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding:32px 16px;\"">\n    <table width=\""580\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""max-width:580px;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\"">\n\n      <!-- HEADER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#1a1a1a;padding:28px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <span style=\""color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;\"">Hair Solutions Co.</span>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- BODY -->\n      <tr><td style=\""padding:40px;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"">\n        <h2 style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;margin:0 0 20px;color:#1a1a1a;\"">Hi {{ contact.firstname | default(\""there\"") }},</h2>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">It’s been a while, and I just wanted to check in.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">I’m Vincent, one of the founders at Hair Solutions Co. I noticed it’s been some time since we last connected, and I wanted to reach out personally — not with an offer, just to say hello.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">If you’re still wearing a system, I hope things are going well. If you’ve moved on or your situation has changed, I completely understand.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">And if there’s anything we could have done better — whether with our product, our communication, or anything else — I’d genuinely like to hear it. Honest feedback helps us improve, and I read every reply.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">No pressure at all. Just wanted to make sure you know we’re here if you ever need us.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">&mdash; Vincent<br>Hair Solutions Co.</p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- FOOTER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.5;\"">Hair Solutions Co. &bull; <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co\"" style=\""color:#999999;text-decoration:none;\"">hairsolutions.co</a></p>\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"">\n          <a href=\""{{ unsubscribe_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Unsubscribe</a> &bull;\n          <a href=\""{{ subscription_preferences_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Manage preferences</a>\n        </p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>"",""schema_version"":2}",537befeb3af351bec4db5df701d9fc9d4340203a44c5b2951c467c7848156645,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_211345979664_module_1_0_0_1,211345979664,J7-E1 — Just checking in — Vincent here,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,2,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_211345979996_module_0_0_0_0,211345979996,J3-E6 — Week 2: building your maintenance routine,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<table width=\""100%\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;\"">\n  <tr><td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding:32px 16px;\"">\n    <table width=\""580\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""max-width:580px;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\"">\n\n      <!-- HEADER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#1a1a1a;padding:28px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <span style=\""color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;\"">Hair Solutions Co.</span>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- BODY -->\n      <tr><td style=\""padding:40px;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"">\n        <h2 style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;margin:0 0 20px;color:#1a1a1a;\"">Week 2: settling in.</h2>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Hi {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }}, if you’ve made it through your first week, you’re past the steepest part of the learning curve. Week two is about building a routine that fits your life.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\""><strong>What to establish this week:</strong></p>\n<ul style=\""padding-left:20px;margin:0 0 18px;\""><li style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#333333;margin-bottom:8px;\""><strong>Wash schedule:</strong> Most wearers find a rhythm of every 5–10 days, depending on activity level and scalp type. Find what works for yours.</li><li style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#333333;margin-bottom:8px;\""><strong>Re-application:</strong> If you’re using tape or glue, this is the week to practice your removal and re-application process. Go slowly — speed comes with repetition.</li><li style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#333333;margin-bottom:8px;\""><strong>Products:</strong> Keep your product lineup simple for now. Scalp protector before application, gentle shampoo for washing, light conditioner or leave-in for the hair. Nothing heavy near the base edges.</li></ul>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">By the end of this week, you should have a basic rhythm. It won’t be perfect — that’s normal. The goal is consistency, not perfection.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">We’ll check in with you next week with some styling and removal guidance.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">&mdash; Hair Solutions Co.</p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- FOOTER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.5;\"">Hair Solutions Co. &bull; <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co\"" style=\""color:#999999;text-decoration:none;\"">hairsolutions.co</a></p>\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"">\n          <a href=\""{{ unsubscribe_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Unsubscribe</a> &bull;\n          <a href=\""{{ subscription_preferences_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Manage preferences</a>\n        </p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>"",""schema_version"":2}",c9ee2b6926cef8ddc37ca07ca05aef2c77c67657261d486fcccff1918ae44602,Tru