usage_211682259546_module_3_0_0_4,211682259546,Test for Cursor,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/product_sale.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-3-0-0,module-3-0-0,module,6,section-3,3,0,0,,"{""align"":""left"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""display"":""default"",""font"":{""color"":""#fffffe"",""font"":""Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif"",""font_set"":""DEFAULT"",""size"":{""units"":""px"",""value"":15}},""footer_html"":""<p><span style=\""font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #fffffe;\"">, , , ,,,,</span></p>\n<p style=\""text-align: left;\""><span style=\""font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #fffffe;\"">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\""font-size: 15px; line-height: 125%; text-align: left;\""><span style=\""font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #fffffe;\""><a href=\""{{ unsubscribe_link_all }}\"" style=\""color: #fffffe;\"" data-unsubscribe=\""true\""></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\""{{ unsubscribe_link }}\"" style=\""color: #fffffe;\"" data-unsubscribe=\""true\""></a></span></p>"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""28px"",""padding-left"":""20px"",""padding-right"":""20px"",""padding-top"":""0px""},""lineNumber"":95,""link_font"":{""color"":""#fffffe"",""font"":""Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif"",""size"":{""units"":""px"",""value"":15},""styles"":{""bold"":false,""italic"":false,""underline"":true}},""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-408,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",ddb4a7c2fb95e5422072056add075ea88457369c6ba1794a7e1bd54d102ed3a8,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971489_module_0_0_0_0,214987971489,WF-AbandonedCart-02-Value-Reinforcement,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<p>Hi {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }},</p>\n\n<p>Making a decision about a hair system is personal, and I understand if you want to take your time.</p>\n\n<p>Here's what you can count on when you order from Hair Solutions Co.:</p>\n\n<p><strong>✅ Premium quality</strong> — 100% human hair, hand-tied for natural movement and appearance.</p>\n\n<p><strong>✅ Full tracking</strong> — You'll know exactly where your order is at every step, from production to your door.</p>\n\n<p><strong>✅ Personal service</strong> — I'm the founder, and I personally oversee every order. You're not dealing with a faceless company.</p>\n\n<p><strong>✅ Satisfaction guarantee</strong> — If something isn't right, we make it right. Period.</p>\n\n<p><strong>What customers say:</strong></p>\n<p><em>\""I was hesitant at first, but the quality exceeded my expectations. And Vincent's personal follow-up made me feel like a valued customer, not just a number.\""</em></p>\n\n<p>Your cart is still saved:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/cart?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=abandoned-cart&utm_content=wf-cart-02&utm_term=hero-cta\"" style=\""background-color:#1a1a2e;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 24px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;font-weight:bold;\"">Return to Cart →</a></p>\n\n<p>Questions? Reply here — I respond personally.</p>\n\n<p>Vincent</p>"",""schema_version"":2}",900fc884fac8deb174c801adc1afb05109b0a0062fa11d6b0112e1c0851c5a85,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971489_module_1_0_0_1,214987971489,WF-AbandonedCart-02-Value-Reinforcement,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971492_module_0_0_0_0,214987971492,WF-AbandonedCart-03-Urgency-Incentive,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<p>Hi {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }},</p>\n\n<p>Just a heads up — your saved cart will expire soon, and I'd hate for you to lose what you selected.</p>\n\n<p>To make this easier, I'd like to offer you something:</p>\n\n<p style=\""font-size:18px;background-color:#f8f9fa;padding:16px;border-left:4px solid #1a1a2e;\"">\n<strong>Free shipping on your order</strong><br>\nUse code: <strong>FREESHIP</strong> at checkout<br>\n<em>Valid for 48 hours</em>\n</p>\n\n<p><a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/cart?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=abandoned-cart&utm_content=wf-cart-03&utm_term=hero-cta\"" style=\""background-color:#1a1a2e;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 24px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;font-weight:bold;\"">Complete Your Order →</a></p>\n\n<p>Every order includes full tracking, quality guarantee, and my personal oversight.</p>\n\n<p>If you've decided this isn't the right time, no worries at all. We'll be here whenever you're ready.</p>\n\n<p>Vincent Laroche<br>\nFounder, Hair Solutions Co.</p>"",""schema_version"":2}",4a38906a0d3d38cea9df68890f6a628069e7312077146f38126033319d097960,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971492_module_1_0_0_1,214987971492,WF-AbandonedCart-03-Urgency-Incentive,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971495_module_0_0_0_0,214987971495,WF-BrowseAbandon-01-Product-Reminder,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<p>Hi {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }},</p>\n\n<p>We noticed you were browsing our hair systems recently — and I wanted to reach out in case you had any questions.</p>\n\n<p>Choosing the right system can feel overwhelming with all the options available. Here's what I'd suggest:</p>\n\n<p><strong>If you're not sure about base type:</strong> Start with our comparison guide that breaks down lace, poly, and hybrid bases in plain language.</p>\n\n<p><strong>If you're not sure about sizing:</strong> Our measurement guide makes it simple — you just need a tape measure and 5 minutes.</p>\n\n<p><strong>If you want personalized advice:</strong> Reply to this email with what you're looking for and I'll give you my honest recommendation.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/collections/all?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=browse-abandon&utm_content=wf-browse-01&utm_term=hero-cta\"" style=\""background-color:#1a1a2e;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 24px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;font-weight:bold;\"">View Our Collection →</a></p>\n\n<p>No pressure. I just want to make sure you find the right fit.</p>\n\n<p>Vincent</p>"",""schema_version"":2}",445c4c8a032d7cd51a8279e692139b9d3178f0c926059b1ae38481d27b608298,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971495_module_1_0_0_1,214987971495,WF-BrowseAbandon-01-Product-Reminder,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971498_module_0_0_0_0,214987971498,WF-BrowseAbandon-02-Related-Products,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<p>Hi {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }},</p>\n\n<p>Since you were browsing our hair systems, I thought you might be interested in seeing some of our most popular options.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Our customers' top picks:</strong></p>\n\n<p>🔹 <strong>HS1V Lace Front</strong> — Our most natural-looking system. Invisible hairline, lightweight, and breathable. Perfect for those who prioritize appearance.<br>\n<a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/collections/lace?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=browse-abandon&utm_content=wf-browse-02&utm_term=product-1\"">View Lace Systems →</a></p>\n\n<p>🔹 <strong>HS2V Poly Base</strong> — Durable and low-maintenance. Easy to apply and clean. Great for active lifestyles.<br>\n<a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/collections/poly?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=browse-abandon&utm_content=wf-browse-02&utm_term=product-2\"">View Poly Systems →</a></p>\n\n<p>🔹 <strong>HS3V Hybrid</strong> — Lace front with poly perimeter. The best of both worlds for natural appearance AND durability.<br>\n<a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/collections/hybrid?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=browse-abandon&utm_content=wf-browse-02&utm_term=product-3\"">View Hybrid Systems →</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/collections/all?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=browse-abandon&utm_content=wf-browse-02&utm_term=hero-cta\"" style=\""background-color:#1a1a2e;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 24px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;font-weight:bold;\"">Explore All Hair Systems →</a></p>\n\n<p>Reply any time if you'd like a personal recommendation.</p>\n\n<p>Vincent</p>"",""schema_version"":2}",bb7874d63a32c3784ef886a97fd6f18c0a6216e484f9298284c9752301cd9bde,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971498_module_1_0_0_1,214987971498,WF-BrowseAbandon-02-Related-Products,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971501_module_0_0_0_0,214987971501,WF-CrossSell-01-Care-Kit-Intro,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<p>Hi {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }},</p>\n\n<p>Now that your hair system is installed, there's one more thing that will make a big difference in how long it lasts and how good it looks: <strong>the right care products</strong>.</p>\n\n<p>Think of it like buying a car — the car is great, but you need the right oil, tires, and maintenance to keep it running well.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Essential care products for your system:</strong></p>\n\n<p>🔹 <strong>Adhesive/Tape</strong> — The right hold for your lifestyle. We carry options for active lifestyles, sensitive skin, and easy removal.<br>\n\n<p>🔹 <strong>Adhesive Remover</strong> — Safely removes your system without damaging the base or your skin.<br>\n\n<p>🔹 <strong>Scalp Cleanser</strong> — Prepares your scalp for a clean, strong bond every time.<br>\n\n<p>🔹 <strong>Shampoo & Conditioner</strong> — Sulfate-free formulas that protect both the hair and the base material.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/collections/maintenance?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=cross-sell&utm_content=wf-crosssell-01&utm_term=hero-cta\"" style=\""background-color:#1a1a2e;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 24px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;font-weight:bold;\"">Shop Care Essentials →</a></p>\n\n<p>Not sure which products are right for your base type? Reply and I'll recommend exactly what you need.</p>\n\n<p>Vincent</p>"",""schema_version"":2}",e75482fcb19bcfbf323fc24e8469dfae2113829ec58245617655264fa00c6fbf,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971501_module_1_0_0_1,214987971501,WF-CrossSell-01-Care-Kit-Intro,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971504_module_0_0_0_0,214987971504,WF-NewCustomer-03-Care-Instructions-CrossSell,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<p>Hi {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }},</p>\n\n<p>By now you should have had some time with your new hair system. I hope you're loving the results!</p>\n\n<p>To help you get the maximum lifespan from your system, here are the care essentials:</p>\n\n<p><strong>Daily care:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Style gently — treat it like your natural hair</li>\n<li>Avoid excessive heat (use low-medium settings on styling tools)</li>\n<li>Protect from chlorine and salt water when swimming</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Weekly maintenance:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Wash with sulfate-free shampoo every 5-7 days</li>\n<li>Condition lightly — avoid the base area</li>\n<li>Inspect your adhesive bond and touch up edges if needed</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Monthly service:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove the system completely for a deep clean</li>\n<li>Clean your scalp thoroughly</li>\n<li>Reapply with fresh adhesive for the strongest hold</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>The right products make all the difference.</strong> Using the correct adhesive, tape, and cleanser for your base type protects your investment and extends the life of your system significantly.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/collections/maintenance?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=new-customer-flow&utm_content=wf-newcust-03&utm_term=hero-cta\"" style=\""background-color:#1a1a2e;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 24px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;font-weight:bold;\"">Shop Maintenance Essentials →</a></p>\n\n<p>Questions about care? Reply any time — I'm here to help.</p>\n\n<p>Vincent</p>"",""schema_version"":2}",4aa009e4ac5a08629304c7d0d419b92bde768a869078fc3010d47143df0ad817,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971504_module_1_0_0_1,214987971504,WF-NewCustomer-03-Care-Instructions-CrossSell,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971507_module_0_0_0_0,214987971507,WF-NewCustomer-04-CheckIn-Review-Request,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<p>Hi {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }},</p>\n\n<p>It's been about three weeks since your order — and I'm curious: <strong>how are you feeling about your hair system?</strong></p>\n\n<p>Your feedback means the world to me. As a founder-operated business, every review and comment helps me understand what we're doing right and where we can improve.</p>\n\n<p>Would you take 30 seconds to share your experience?</p>\n\n<p><a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/pages/reviews?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=new-customer-flow&utm_content=wf-newcust-04&utm_term=hero-cta\"" style=\""background-color:#1a1a2e;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 24px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;font-weight:bold;\"">Leave a Review →</a></p>\n\n<p>Whether it's a quick star rating or a detailed review, it genuinely helps other people who are considering taking the same step you did.</p>\n\n<p>And if something isn't right — please tell me directly. Reply to this email and I'll personally make it right.</p>\n\n<p>Thank you for being part of Hair Solutions Co.</p>\n\n<p>Warmly,<br>\nVincent Laroche<br>\nFounder, Hair Solutions Co.</p>"",""schema_version"":2}",cc6a4b8e8896918b0ba01e7b38eed7a0fd1a30e8f51342b3e903f03feaabb446,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971507_module_1_0_0_1,214987971507,WF-NewCustomer-04-CheckIn-Review-Request,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971510_module_0_0_0_0,214987971510,WF-Reorder-03-Last-Reminder-NewProducts,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<p>Hi {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }},</p>\n\n<p>Just a final reminder — if you haven't restocked your maintenance products yet, now's a good time.</p>\n\n<p>We've also been expanding our maintenance line with new products:</p>\n\n<p>🆕 <strong>New adhesive options</strong> — More choices for different skin types and activity levels<br>\n🆕 <strong>Travel-sized kits</strong> — Everything you need in a compact size<br>\n🆕 <strong>Premium care products</strong> — Enhanced formulas for longer system life</p>\n\n<p><a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/collections/maintenance?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=reorder-flow&utm_content=wf-reorder-03&utm_term=hero-cta\"" style=\""background-color:#1a1a2e;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 24px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;font-weight:bold;\"">Shop Maintenance →</a></p>\n\n<p>As always, reply if you need any help choosing the right products.</p>\n\n<p>Vincent</p>"",""schema_version"":2}",e94eb59af2978e65bd0b04bf72d7a04a882f3ce47738485025f41188986973dd,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971510_module_1_0_0_1,214987971510,WF-Reorder-03-Last-Reminder-NewProducts,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971586_module_0_0_0_0,214987971586,WF-Review-02-UGC-Photo-Request,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<p>Hi {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }},</p>\n\n<p>I have a small request — and there's something in it for you.</p>\n\n<p>We're building a gallery of real customers wearing our hair systems, and I'd love to feature <strong>your look</strong>.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Here's how it works:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Take a photo of yourself wearing your system (selfie works great!)</li>\n<li>Reply to this email with the photo, or upload it through our form</li>\n<li>We'll feature you on our website (with your permission)</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p><strong>What's in it for you:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>🎉 Featured on our website's customer gallery</li>\n<li>💰 <strong>10% off your next order</strong> as a thank you</li>\n<li>🤝 Help other guys see that real people get real results</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/pages/share-your-look?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=review-flow&utm_content=wf-review-02&utm_term=hero-cta\"" style=\""background-color:#1a1a2e;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 24px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;font-weight:bold;\"">Share Your Photo →</a></p>\n\n<p>No professional photography needed — just a natural shot that shows your system in action.</p>\n\n<p>Thanks,<br>\nVincent</p>"",""schema_version"":2}",476b8d4a5361daa489674383cf12a89f8d4a9a5112ad3c2d72a11e0a4c3e14cb,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971586_module_1_0_0_1,214987971586,WF-Review-02-UGC-Photo-Request,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971589_module_0_0_0_0,214987971589,WF-Welcome-04-First-Purchase-Incentive,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\""UTF-8\"">\n<style>\nbody { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }\np { margin: 0 0 16px 0; }\n.container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }\n.offer-box { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2D6A4F 0%, #1e4d38 100%); color: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 4px; text-align: center; margin: 20px 0; }\n.discount { font-size: 48px; font-weight: bold; margin: 15px 0; letter-spacing: -1px; }\n.code { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: monospace; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; margin: 15px 0; letter-spacing: 3px; display: inline-block; }\n.process-step { background: #f5f5f5; padding: 14px; margin: 12px 0; border-left: 4px solid #2D6A4F; }\n.step-num { color: #2D6A4F; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; }\na { color: #2D6A4F; text-decoration: underline; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\""container\"">\n\n<p>Hi {{contact.firstname}},</p>\n\n<p>You've read about the systems, the bases, the customer stories. You're still here. That tells me you're seriously considering it.</p>\n\n<p>Let me make this easier.</p>\n\n<div class=\""offer-box\"">\n<p style=\""margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px;\"">FIRST-TIME BUYER OFFER</p>\n<div class=\""discount\"">10% Off</div>\n<p style=\""margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px;\"">Your first order</p>\n<div class=\""code\"">WELCOME10</div>\n</div>\n\n<p><strong>Here's what happens after you order:</strong></p>\n\n<div class=\""process-step\"">\n<p><span class=\""step-num\"">1. Order Confirmation</span><br>\nYou'll get an email within 1 hour with your order details. Nothing gets missed.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\""process-step\"">\n<p><span class=\""step-num\"">2. Personal Review</span><br>\nI personally check every order before it ships. If something looks off or needs clarification, we reach out immediately.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\""process-step\"">\n<p><span class=\""step-num\"">3. Real Tracking</span><br>\nWithin 24 hours, you get a tracking number. You know exactly where your system is at every stage.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\""process-step\"">\n<p><span class=\""step-num\"">4. Preparation Guide</span><br>\nBefore arrival, you get a step-by-step guide on unboxing, sizing, initial styling, and care. No surprises.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\""process-step\"">\n<p><span class=\""step-num\"">5. You're Ready</span><br>\nSystem arrives, you've got the knowledge, and you can start using it immediately.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>Not \""you order and hope.\"" Not \""customer service responds in 3 days.\"" You're covered at every step.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Need help deciding?</strong> Message me on WhatsApp or email. I read everything personally.</p>\n\n<p>Ready to get started?</p>\n\n<p>—Vincent</p>\n\n<table width=\""100%\"" border=\""0\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding: 20px 0;\"">\n      <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/collections/all?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=welcome-series&utm_content=welcome-04-incentive&utm_term=main-cta\"" style=\""background-color: #2D6A4F; color: white; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;\"">Shop Now — 10% Off</a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<p style=\""text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\""><a href=\""https://wa.me/1234567890?text=Hi%20Vincent,%20I%20have%20questions%20about%20my%20first%20order&utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=welcome-series&utm_content=welcome-04-incentive&utm_term=secondary-cta\"" style=\""color: #2D6A4F; text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14px;\"">Questions? Message Me on WhatsApp</a></p>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"",""schema_version"":2}",1b30f913543b02adaefa9bf6f61f0e3a13cc80713c8a48055b28fe508c2d9aaa,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971589_module_1_0_0_1,214987971589,WF-Welcome-04-First-Purchase-Incentive,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971592_module_0_0_0_0,214987971592,WF-Welcome-05-Soft-Close-Buying-Guide,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\""UTF-8\"">\n<style>\nbody { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }\np { margin: 0 0 16px 0; }\n.container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }\n.concern-box { background: #f9f9f9; padding: 16px; margin: 16px 0; border-left: 4px solid #2D6A4F; }\n.concern-title { color: #2D6A4F; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.icon { font-size: 20px; margin-right: 8px; }\na { color: #2D6A4F; text-decoration: underline; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\""container\"">\n\n<p>Hi {{contact.firstname}},</p>\n\n<p>You've gotten emails about bases, social proof, and offers. But I know some of you are still sitting with questions. Real questions. Let me address the ones I hear most.</p>\n\n<div class=\""concern-box\"">\n<p class=\""concern-title\"">SIZING — \""How Do I Know It'll Fit?\""</p>\n<p>You measure from the front of your hairline to the nape of your neck, and ear-to-ear. That's it. Takes 2 minutes. If you're between sizes, go larger — we can always trim to fit. I include a detailed measurement guide with every order, and I'm available by WhatsApp if you get stuck.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\""concern-box\"">\n<p class=\""concern-title\"">CARE — \""Isn't This Going to be Complicated?\""</p>\n<p>No. The routine is: wash 2-3x per week, let it air dry or blow dry on cool, apply leave-in conditioner, brush it out. That's 5 minutes max. We include everything you need in your first order. No running around to specialty stores for weird products.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\""concern-box\"">\n<p class=\""concern-title\"">TIMELINE — \""How Long Before I Get It?\""</p>\n<p>7-10 business days from order to ship. Then 3-5 days shipping depending on your location. So typically you're wearing it 2-3 weeks from when you order. I include tracking at every stage so you're not guessing.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\""concern-box\"">\n<p class=\""concern-title\"">COST — \""Is This Actually Worth It?\""</p>\n<p>Most systems last 8-14 months depending on wear and maintenance. That breaks down to $5-7 per week of confidence. The durability and natural look of a quality system beats cheaper alternatives because you're not replacing it every 3 months. Plus, you avoid the emotional toll of something falling apart or looking fake.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\""concern-box\"">\n<p class=\""concern-title\"">NATURAL LOOK — \""Will People Know?\""</p>\n<p>A quality system from us? No. The hairline looks real. The texture matches real hair. We use ethically sourced human hair, not synthetic. The only way someone knows is if you tell them or they're looking for it.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p><strong>Here's the truth:</strong> The biggest regret I hear from customers isn't \""I shouldn't have ordered.\"" It's \""I wish I'd done it sooner.\"" The difference in how you feel is real.</p>\n\n<p>You don't have to decide today. But when you're ready, I'm here.</p>\n\n<p>—Vincent</p>\n\n<table width=\""100%\"" border=\""0\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding: 20px 0;\"">\n      <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/blogs/education?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=welcome-series&utm_content=welcome-05-buying-guide&utm_term=main-cta\"" style=\""background-color: #2D6A4F; color: white; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;\"">Read the Complete Buying Guide</a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<p style=\""text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;\""><a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/pages/contact?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=welcome-series&utm_content=welcome-05-buying-guide&utm_term=secondary-cta\"" style=\""color: #2D6A4F; text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14px;\"">Still Have Questions? Let's Talk</a></p>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"",""schema_version"":2}",77321ccbc9c957ceea2e9ab562c4ed9140f10bc7cd4c5da65332db86a4690b23,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971592_module_1_0_0_1,214987971592,WF-Welcome-05-Soft-Close-Buying-Guide,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971595_module_0_0_0_0,214987971595,WF-Winback-02-Whats-New,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<p>Hi {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }},</p>\n\n<p>Since your last visit, we've been busy making Hair Solutions Co. better in every way. Here's what's new:</p>\n\n<p><strong>🆕 New website</strong><br>\nWe've completely rebuilt our online store at <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co\"">hairsolutions.co</a>. Easier browsing, better product information, and a smoother checkout experience.</p>\n\n<p><strong>🆕 Expanded product line</strong><br>\nNew base types, more color options, and additional density choices. Whatever your preference, we likely have a better match for you now.</p>\n\n<p><strong>🆕 Better service</strong><br>\nEvery order now ships with tracking. I personally oversee fulfillment. And our communication is proactive — you'll never be left wondering.</p>\n\n<p><strong>🆕 Maintenance products</strong><br>\nA full line of adhesives, tapes, removers, and care products to keep your system looking great.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/collections/all?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=winback-flow&utm_content=wf-winback-02&utm_term=hero-cta\"" style=\""background-color:#1a1a2e;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 24px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;font-weight:bold;\"">See What's New →</a></p>\n\n<p>Vincent</p>"",""schema_version"":2}",541345bd11ef37551049cce1d1749fb0cee8af495536d9966d5ae0bb20c69635,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971595_module_1_0_0_1,214987971595,WF-Winback-02-Whats-New,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971598_module_0_0_0_0,214987971598,WF-Winback-03-Reengagement-Offer,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<table width=\""100%\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;\"">\n  <tr><td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding:32px 16px;\"">\n    <table width=\""580\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""max-width:580px;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\"">\n\n      <!-- HEADER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#1a1a1a;padding:28px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <span style=\""color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;\"">Hair Solutions Co.</span>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- BODY -->\n      <tr><td style=\""padding:40px;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"">\n        <h2 style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;margin:0 0 20px;color:#1a1a1a;\"">Hi {{ contact.firstname | default(\""there\"") }},</h2>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">It’s been a little while, so I wanted to reach out one more time with something concrete.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">For a limited time, we’re offering a discount on your next order — new system, replacement, or accessories.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">If you’ve been on the fence about coming back, this is a good moment to do it. The offer won’t be available indefinitely.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">If now isn’t the right time, no worries — we’ll still be here.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">&mdash; The Hair Solutions Co. Team</p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- FOOTER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.5;\"">Hair Solutions Co. &bull; <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co\"" style=\""color:#999999;text-decoration:none;\"">hairsolutions.co</a></p>\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"">\n          <a href=\""{{ unsubscribe_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Unsubscribe</a> &bull;\n          <a href=\""{{ subscription_preferences_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Manage preferences</a>\n        </p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>"",""lineNumber"":32,""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":19}",2e404cc56c5143ea846fabcfa31254ce600eeb62c95b996536de20c181ded0ce,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971598_module_1_0_0_1,214987971598,WF-Winback-03-Reengagement-Offer,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""font"":{""color"":""{{is_ungated_for_email_branded_templates && style_settings.initial_source == \""BRANDED_TEMPLATE\"" ? style_settings.primary_font_color : \""#23496d\""}}"",""font"":""Arial, sans-serif"",""size"":{""units"":""px"",""value"":12}},""lineNumber"":61,""link_font"":{""color"":""{{is_ungated_for_email_branded_templates && style_settings.initial_source == \""BRANDED_TEMPLATE\"" ? style_settings.primary_font_color : \""#00a4bd\""}}"",""font"":""Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif"",""size"":{""units"":""px"",""value"":12},""styles"":{""bold"":false,""italic"":false,""underline"":true}},""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-973,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",1308b335f0e023a29469126e487a69541697de9958fbf8c8897a72940cf6208d,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971610_module_0_0_0_0,214987971610,CP-W2-Trust-Rebuilding-Personal-Note,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<p>Hi {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }},</p>\n\n<p>I want to be transparent with you about something.</p>\n\n<p>In 2025, our business went through a difficult period. Operations broke down, communication failed, and some customers had experiences that didn't meet the standard they deserved. I take full responsibility for that.</p>\n\n<p>But I didn't walk away. Instead, I rebuilt — from the ground up.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Here's my promise to you:</strong></p>\n\n<p>✅ <strong>Transparency</strong> — If there's ever an issue with your order, you'll hear about it from me directly. No silence, no excuses.</p>\n\n<p>✅ <strong>Tracking on every order</strong> — You'll always know exactly where your order is.</p>\n\n<p>✅ <strong>Personal oversight</strong> — I'm a one-person operation by choice. That means every order gets my full attention.</p>\n\n<p>✅ <strong>Quality first</strong> — I'd rather delay an order than ship something that doesn't meet our standards.</p>\n\n<p>I'm not asking you to take my word for it. I'm asking you to give me a chance to show you through action.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/pages/about?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=2026-02-trust-rebuild&utm_content=cp-w2-trust&utm_term=hero-cta\"" style=\""background-color:#1a1a2e;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 24px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;font-weight:bold;\"">Read Our Story →</a></p>\n\n<p>Thank you for being here.</p>\n\n<p>Vincent Laroche<br>\nFounder, Hair Solutions Co.<br>\nvincent@hairsolutions.co</p>"",""schema_version"":2}",97c78ec8dfc4b7ee0f6fe3f469b6e289a22c3b02d11a2341b889c929690d224d,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971610_module_1_0_0_1,214987971610,CP-W2-Trust-Rebuilding-Personal-Note,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971613_module_0_0_0_0,214987971613,CP-W4-Social-Proof-Testimonials,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<p>Hi {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }},</p>\n\n<p>I could talk all day about the quality of our hair systems — but I think our customers say it better than I ever could.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Here's what real customers are saying:</strong></p>\n\n<p>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐<br>\n<em>\""The quality is incredible. I've been wearing hair systems for years, and this is the best I've had. The lace front is completely invisible.\""</em><br>\n— <strong>Customer since 2024</strong></p>\n\n<p>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐<br>\n<em>\""What sets Hair Solutions apart is Vincent's personal service. He follows up, he cares, and the product quality backs it up.\""</em><br>\n— <strong>Repeat customer</strong></p>\n\n<p>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐<br>\n<em>\""I was skeptical about ordering online, but the product matched my specs perfectly. The color, density, and fit were spot-on.\""</em><br>\n— <strong>First-time buyer</strong></p>\n\n<p>These aren't just words — they're the standard we hold ourselves to with every single order.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/pages/transformations?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=2026-02-social-proof&utm_content=cp-w4-testimonials&utm_term=hero-cta\"" style=\""background-color:#1a1a2e;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 24px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;font-weight:bold;\"">See Transformations →</a></p>\n\n<p>Vincent</p>"",""schema_version"":2}",f23bf58b0a2cf8e8fb72bc2d7eb64efb470966dd5c1dc2b663e9fcc58159f146,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971613_module_1_0_0_1,214987971613,CP-W4-Social-Proof-Testimonials,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
