usage_214987971616_module_1_0_0_1,214987971616,CP W8 — Hybrid Mono Education,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,,module-1-0-0,,,,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""28px"",""padding-left"":""40px"",""padding-right"":""40px"",""padding-top"":""16px""},""html"":""<div style=\""font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:150%;color:#FFFFFF;\""><h1 style=\""margin:0;font-family:Arial Black,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:52px;line-height:108%;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.3px;text-align:center;color:#FFFFFF;\"">HYBRID & MONO. THE VERSATILE CHOICE.</h1><p style=\""margin:16px 0 0 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;text-align:center;color:#FFFFFF;\"">Hybrid and mono systems — versatility meets performance.</p></div>"",""lineNumber"":94,""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-442}",45bf92448a2ee5caa966c9441213cfa48df1931aa3f2d6678377ec6d51170041,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971616_module_2_0_0_2,214987971616,CP W8 — Hybrid Mono Education,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_image_email,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/image_email,,module-2-0-0,,,,section-2,2,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""20px"",""padding-left"":""20px"",""padding-right"":""20px"",""padding-top"":""20px""},""img"":{""alt"":""Hollywood mono hair system showcasing natural scalp appearance and versatile styling"",""height"":320,""loading"":""disabled"",""src"":""https://res.cloudinary.com/dtmizxj1n/image/upload/w_600,q_auto,f_auto/v1/HOLLYWOOD-MONO"",""width"":560},""lineNumber"":61,""link"":""https://hairsolutions.co/collections/hybrid-mono-systems"",""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-1015}",0a1f46f0390c16446dd492dfab212476eb14147617ff2b0dbb4a1610a6e4ac79,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971616_module_3_0_0_3,214987971616,CP W8 — Hybrid Mono Education,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,,module-3-0-0,,,,section-3,3,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""20px"",""padding-left"":""40px"",""padding-right"":""40px"",""padding-top"":""16px""},""html"":""<div style=\""font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:150%;color:#1A1A1A;\""><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\"">You know about lace. You know about poly. But some of the most impressive systems on the market combine the strengths of multiple base types into a single unit. Welcome to hybrid and mono — the systems built for men who refuse to compromise.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>Hybrid systems: engineered balance.</strong> A hybrid base typically features a lace front for that signature undetectable hairline, combined with a poly or skin perimeter for secure adhesion and clean edges. The result is a system that gives you the natural look of lace where it matters most and the durability of poly where you need the strongest hold. It's not a compromise — it's the best of both technologies working together.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>Mono (monofilament) systems: the all-rounder.</strong> Mono bases are constructed from a fine, single-filament mesh that offers a natural scalp appearance from virtually any angle. Unlike lace, mono is more durable and resistant to tearing, making it an excellent choice for men who want longevity without sacrificing realism. Mono systems also allow for multi-directional styling — part your hair left, right, or straight back, and the base moves with you.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>Who should consider hybrid or mono?</strong> If you've tried lace and loved the look but wanted more durability, hybrid is your upgrade. If you change your hairstyle frequently and need a base that adapts, mono gives you that freedom. Both options are ideal for intermediate and experienced wearers who know what they want and are ready for a system that performs on every level.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>Find your match.</strong> We carry a curated selection of hybrid and mono systems in a range of hair densities, colors, and lengths. Whether you're looking for a specific combination of base materials or you want guidance on which configuration suits your lifestyle, our collection has you covered. Explore the options and discover why so many of our customers end up making hybrid or mono their permanent choice.</p></div>"",""lineNumber"":94,""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-442}",fc1d0e207e09f0a0603908842ada7436f6b3f48c114d97a2a75a770676d18339,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
