usage_214987971622_module_2_0_0_2,214987971622,CP W15 — New Arrivals Followup,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_image_email,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/image_email,,module-2-0-0,,,,section-2,2,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""20px"",""padding-left"":""20px"",""padding-right"":""20px"",""padding-top"":""20px""},""img"":{""alt"":""Lace hair systems collection banner showing a range of available styles"",""height"":320,""loading"":""disabled"",""src"":""https://res.cloudinary.com/dtmizxj1n/image/upload/w_600,h_250,c_fill,g_auto,q_auto,f_auto/v1/Lace_Hair_Systems_-_Collection_Banner"",""width"":560},""lineNumber"":61,""link"":""https://hairsolutions.co/collections/new-arrivals"",""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-1015}",844e437bd5d41f120c44f15b1ddedc5a44879ae6b0aff56e4c130f74b623ffce,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214987971622_module_3_0_0_3,214987971622,CP W15 — New Arrivals Followup,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,,module-3-0-0,,,,section-3,3,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""20px"",""padding-left"":""40px"",""padding-right"":""40px"",""padding-top"":""16px""},""html"":""<div style=\""font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:150%;color:#1A1A1A;\""><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\"">Last week we introduced three new hair systems — the Meridian Lace, Apex Hybrid, and Stealth Poly Ultra-Thin. Since then, early orders have shipped and the first impressions are coming in.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\"">One customer told us the Meridian Lace is \""the first system where I genuinely forget I am wearing it.\"" Another said the Apex Hybrid gave him the confidence to start wearing systems full-time after months of hesitation. That is exactly why we developed these — to close the gap between wearing a system and forgetting you are.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>How do they compare to the rest of our lineup?</strong> The Meridian sits alongside our existing full-lace options but with a noticeably thinner base and improved knot sealing. The Apex Hybrid fills a gap we have had between our entry-level and premium tiers — it is easy to attach, holds a strong bond, and looks natural from day one. The Stealth Poly is our thinnest poly system to date, designed for experienced wearers who prioritize an invisible hairline above all else.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\"">To welcome these into the collection, we are offering introductory pricing on all three through the end of the week. If you have been thinking about trying a new base type or upgrading from your current system, this is the time.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\"">Stock from the first production run is moving. Once it is gone, the next batch will not arrive for several weeks.</p></div>"",""lineNumber"":94,""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-442}",72657c774b6041fe4397298725fbde09af6636749f7121907857332c464db8ad,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
