usage_214988060973_module_1_0_0_1,214988060973,CP W5 — Lace Deep Dive,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,,module-1-0-0,,,,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""28px"",""padding-left"":""40px"",""padding-right"":""40px"",""padding-top"":""16px""},""html"":""<div style=\""font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:150%;color:#FFFFFF;\""><h1 style=\""margin:0;font-family:Arial Black,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:52px;line-height:108%;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.3px;text-align:center;color:#FFFFFF;\"">THE LACE ADVANTAGE.</h1><p style=\""margin:16px 0 0 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;text-align:center;color:#FFFFFF;\"">The science behind the most natural-looking hairline.</p></div>"",""lineNumber"":94,""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-442}",92fba6e51f4caade9012bab579686990293a0204c81a8e82407f7912329e0cbd,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214988060973_module_2_0_0_2,214988060973,CP W5 — Lace Deep Dive,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_image_email,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/image_email,,module-2-0-0,,,,section-2,2,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""20px"",""padding-left"":""20px"",""padding-right"":""20px"",""padding-top"":""20px""},""img"":{""alt"":""Close-up detail of a lace front hairpiece showing the natural-looking hairline"",""height"":320,""loading"":""disabled"",""src"":""https://res.cloudinary.com/dtmizxj1n/image/upload/w_600,q_auto,f_auto/v1/Lace_Front_Hairpiece_Detail_2"",""width"":560},""lineNumber"":61,""link"":""https://hairsolutions.co/collections/lace-hair-systems"",""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-1015}",870b55e7bc2c73aa442faabb001533c8e511acf993ed636818b54a0b412ed37d,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214988060973_module_3_0_0_3,214988060973,CP W5 — Lace Deep Dive,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,,module-3-0-0,,,,section-3,3,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""20px"",""padding-left"":""40px"",""padding-right"":""40px"",""padding-top"":""16px""},""html"":""<div style=\""font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:150%;color:#1A1A1A;\""><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\"">If you've spent any time researching hair systems, you've heard the word \""lace\"" more than once. There's a reason for that. Lace base systems have earned their reputation as the most natural-looking option on the market, and today we're breaking down exactly why.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>The hairline that disappears.</strong> Lace bases are constructed from a fine, semi-transparent mesh that mimics the appearance of your scalp. Each hair is individually hand-tied into the lace, creating a hairline so realistic that even up close, it's virtually undetectable. This is the same technology used in film and television — when the goal is zero detection, lace is the answer.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>Breathability you can feel.</strong> Unlike solid base materials, lace allows air to flow freely through the mesh. If you live in a warm climate, work out regularly, or simply value comfort, lace delivers. Many of our customers tell us they forget they're wearing a system at all — and that's the entire point.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>Who is lace best for?</strong> Lace systems are ideal for men who prioritize a natural front hairline and maximum comfort. They work beautifully for first-time wearers who want the most seamless transition, and for anyone who styles their hair away from the face. If you want the look that makes people say \""did you change your shampoo?\"" instead of \""is that a hairpiece?\"" — lace is your answer.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>Our top lace picks.</strong> We've curated our most popular lace systems for every hair type and lifestyle. From French lace for ultra-fine transparency to Swiss lace for added durability, there's a system built for exactly how you live. Explore the collection and see the difference for yourself.</p></div>"",""lineNumber"":94,""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-442}",0dcfe73dd136e5d8454f118ee7e92a5e03b67c84bc1a63db3f027a5121b1eadb,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
