usage_214988060994_module_3_0_0_3,214988060994,CP W24 — Mid Year Sale,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,,module-3-0-0,,,,section-3,3,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""20px"",""padding-left"":""40px"",""padding-right"":""40px"",""padding-top"":""16px""},""html"":""<div style=\""font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:150%;color:#1A1A1A;\""><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\"">Six months into 2026, and we have a lot to be grateful for. More customers than ever have trusted us with their confidence this year, and we want to say thank you the best way we know how — with our biggest mid-year sale yet.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\"">For the next 5 days, <strong>everything on the site is 25% off</strong>. Hair systems, care products, application kits, maintenance bundles — all of it. No exclusions, no minimum order. Use code <strong>MIDYEAR25</strong> at checkout.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\"">If you have been thinking about trying a new base type, stocking up on maintenance essentials before summer travel, or picking up a backup system to have in rotation, this is the best pricing we will offer until Black Friday. That is not a marketing line — it is a genuine commitment.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\"">For our repeat customers, we want you to know that this sale exists because of you. Every reorder, every referral, every review you have left has helped us grow into a company that can offer better products at better prices. This discount is our way of returning that loyalty.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>Sale ends Friday at midnight EST.</strong> No extensions, no rain checks. Once the timer runs out, prices go back to full. If there is something you have had your eye on, now is the time.</p></div>"",""lineNumber"":94,""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-442}",6037476a83ca77d4acb5740d2c5fce5700e519a6f87e07f43985c89da3054026,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
