usage_214988406450_module_1_0_0_1,214988406450,CP W25 — Travel Care Education,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,,module-1-0-0,,,,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""28px"",""padding-left"":""40px"",""padding-right"":""40px"",""padding-top"":""16px""},""html"":""<div style=\""font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:150%;color:#FFFFFF;\""><h1 style=\""margin:0;font-family:Arial Black,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:52px;line-height:108%;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.3px;text-align:center;color:#FFFFFF;\"">YOUR SUMMER TRAVEL CARE GUIDE.</h1><p style=\""margin:16px 0 0 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;text-align:center;color:#FFFFFF;\"">Heat, humidity, swimming — your summer game plan.</p></div>"",""lineNumber"":94,""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-442}",fb2a9f254e45b18b175fac45272f3953f0a539feae7d303bd02c5b9b3fdedc61,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214988406450_module_2_0_0_2,214988406450,CP W25 — Travel Care Education,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_image_email,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/image_email,,module-2-0-0,,,,section-2,2,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""20px"",""padding-left"":""20px"",""padding-right"":""20px"",""padding-top"":""20px""},""img"":{""alt"":""Ghost Bond XL adhesive bottle — travel care essential (temporary — GAP-05 needs AI generation)"",""height"":320,""loading"":""disabled"",""src"":""https://res.cloudinary.com/dtmizxj1n/image/upload/w_600,q_auto,f_auto/v1/GHOSTBOND_XL_Adhesive_Bottle"",""width"":560},""lineNumber"":61,""link"":""https://hairsolutions.co/collections/travel-kits"",""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-1015}",d05b7183b98dc775de76bda0951f58edd878bd37c5df8d8afaa91a0d0fcd4820,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214988406450_module_3_0_0_3,214988406450,CP W25 — Travel Care Education,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,,module-3-0-0,,,,section-3,3,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""20px"",""padding-left"":""40px"",""padding-right"":""40px"",""padding-top"":""16px""},""html"":""<div style=\""font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:150%;color:#1A1A1A;\""><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\"">Summer travel season is here, and if you are wearing a hair system, a little preparation goes a long way. Whether you are heading to the beach, a destination wedding, or just a week away from your usual routine, here is how to keep your system looking sharp on the road.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>Pack a travel care kit.</strong> You do not need your full maintenance setup — just the essentials. A small bottle of adhesive remover, a travel-sized sulfate-free shampoo, a light leave-in conditioner, a wide-tooth comb, and your adhesive of choice. We put together a pre-packed travel kit that covers all of this in TSA-friendly sizes, so you can toss it in your carry-on without thinking about it.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>Humidity and heat management.</strong> High humidity weakens most adhesive bonds faster than normal conditions. If you are heading somewhere tropical, consider switching to a waterproof or humidity-resistant adhesive for the duration of your trip. Also, avoid leaving your system in direct sunlight for extended periods — UV exposure can shift the color over time, especially on lighter shades.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>Swimming protocol.</strong> You absolutely can swim with a hair system, but preparation matters. Apply a waterproof adhesive at least 24 hours before swimming so the bond fully cures. After swimming — whether pool or ocean — rinse your system with fresh water as soon as possible. Chlorine and salt water are not system-friendly if left to sit.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>Keep a backup bond.</strong> This is the tip most guys wish they had known sooner. Pack a small strip of tape or a single-use adhesive applicator. If your bond loosens while you are away from home, a quick perimeter touch-up takes five minutes and saves you from stress.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\"">Travel should be about the experience, not about worrying over your hair. A little prep before you leave means total confidence while you are there.</p></div>"",""lineNumber"":94,""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-442}",f30f54c2e2fa2f801b200535f27463cdba6f6cab8510359e1367c2b40852e7aa,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
