usage_214988406453_module_1_0_0_1,214988406453,CP W9 — Product Spotlight,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,,module-1-0-0,,,,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""28px"",""padding-left"":""40px"",""padding-right"":""40px"",""padding-top"":""16px""},""html"":""<div style=\""font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:150%;color:#FFFFFF;\""><h1 style=\""margin:0;font-family:Arial Black,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:52px;line-height:108%;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.3px;text-align:center;color:#FFFFFF;\"">THE ONE EVERYONE'S TALKING ABOUT.</h1><p style=\""margin:16px 0 0 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;text-align:center;color:#FFFFFF;\"">The system our customers keep coming back for.</p></div>"",""lineNumber"":94,""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-442}",7ff1ad5e52573c273218d6d958424d53eeb12c6fb7bc4ac25fcb9aa8c6649d3a,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214988406453_module_2_0_0_2,214988406453,CP W9 — Product Spotlight,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_image_email,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/image_email,,module-2-0-0,,,,section-2,2,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""20px"",""padding-left"":""20px"",""padding-right"":""20px"",""padding-top"":""20px""},""img"":{""alt"":""Lace front hair system product shot showing natural hairline detail"",""height"":320,""loading"":""disabled"",""src"":""https://res.cloudinary.com/dtmizxj1n/image/upload/w_600,q_auto,f_auto/v1/Lace-Front-A_0001"",""width"":560},""lineNumber"":61,""link"":""https://hairsolutions.co/collections/best-sellers"",""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-1015}",df424576d460c374a0603492ce165545d8878ef89a083015a0b0b63fab24a76f,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214988406453_module_3_0_0_3,214988406453,CP W9 — Product Spotlight,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,,module-3-0-0,,,,section-3,3,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""20px"",""padding-left"":""40px"",""padding-right"":""40px"",""padding-top"":""16px""},""html"":""<div style=\""font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:150%;color:#1A1A1A;\""><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\"">Every collection has a standout. A product that customers buy once, then reorder again and again. Today, we're putting the spotlight on the system that has earned more five-star reviews, more repeat orders, and more \""where have you been all my life\"" messages than anything else in our catalog.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>What makes it #1?</strong> It starts with the base — a premium French lace front paired with a thin skin poly perimeter, giving you the most natural hairline possible with a hold that doesn't quit. The hair is 100% virgin Remy human hair, hand-tied at a natural density that looks full without looking overdone. It comes pre-cut with a natural front contour, so you can apply and style with minimal effort right out of the box.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>The specs that matter.</strong> 8x10 inch base size fits the majority of coverage needs. Hair length ranges from 6 to 8 inches, long enough for versatile styling but manageable for daily wear. Available in over 20 color options including natural blends and gray percentages, because matching your look shouldn't require compromise. Medium-light density provides that \""just got a great haircut\"" look that draws compliments, not questions.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>What customers are saying.</strong> \""I've tried systems from four different companies. This is the first one my wife said looks completely real.\"" \""Wore it to my daughter's wedding. Nobody knew. Best purchase I've ever made.\"" \""On my third reorder. Nothing else comes close.\"" These aren't outliers — this is the consistent experience our customers report.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>See it for yourself.</strong> Product photos, detailed specs, and the full review gallery are waiting for you. If you've been looking for the system that just works — the one you don't have to think about — this is it.</p></div>"",""lineNumber"":94,""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-442}",79e7b7a5f2117d49dee725fc68a7b619ee659a1611ad59ceb14df1403ed5dba8,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
