usage_214989747030_module_0_0_0_0,214989747030,J3-E2 — Preparation Guide,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<table width=\""100%\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;\"">\n  <tr><td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding:32px 16px;\"">\n    <table width=\""580\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""max-width:580px;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\"">\n\n      <!-- HEADER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#1a1a1a;padding:28px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <span style=\""color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;\"">Hair Solutions Co.</span>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- BODY -->\n      <tr><td style=\""padding:40px;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"">\n        <h2 style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;margin:0 0 20px;color:#1a1a1a;\"">Hi {{ contact.firstname | default(\""there\"") }},</h2>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">While your system is in production, here are a few things you can do to prepare.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">First, make sure your scalp is clean and free of product before application — a clarifying shampoo a day or two before is ideal.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Second, if this is your first system, consider booking a short video call with our team. We’ll walk you through application basics so your first try goes smoothly.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Finally, if you’re applying it yourself, have your adhesive or tape on hand — we’ll include recommendations in your shipping confirmation.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">We’ll let you know as soon as it ships.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">&mdash; The Hair Solutions Co. Team</p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- FOOTER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.5;\"">Hair Solutions Co. &bull; <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co\"" style=\""color:#999999;text-decoration:none;\"">hairsolutions.co</a></p>\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"">\n          <a href=\""{{ unsubscribe_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Unsubscribe</a> &bull;\n          <a href=\""{{ subscription_preferences_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Manage preferences</a>\n        </p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>"",""schema_version"":2}",05d4e87dc01b9fc0b2f3ebc8dbeb7271aef154c38fd012b657ada6bdd8be97d8,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214989747030_module_1_0_0_1,214989747030,J3-E2 — Preparation Guide,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214989747033_module_0_0_0_0,214989747033,J4-E3 — Loyalty Hook,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<table width=\""100%\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;\"">\n  <tr><td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding:32px 16px;\"">\n    <table width=\""580\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""max-width:580px;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\"">\n\n      <!-- HEADER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#1a1a1a;padding:28px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <span style=\""color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;\"">Hair Solutions Co.</span>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- BODY -->\n      <tr><td style=\""padding:40px;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"">\n        <h2 style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;margin:0 0 20px;color:#1a1a1a;\"">Hi {{ contact.firstname | default(\""there\"") }},</h2>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Since you’ve ordered with us before, we wanted to make sure you know about our returning-client benefits.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Repeat orders come with a small loyalty discount automatically applied, plus priority production scheduling — so your next system is ready faster.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">We also keep your measurements, base preference, and color match on file, so reordering takes just a couple of minutes.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">When you’re ready for your next system, just reply or head to the site — your saved details will be right there.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">&mdash; The Hair Solutions Co. Team</p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- FOOTER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.5;\"">Hair Solutions Co. &bull; <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co\"" style=\""color:#999999;text-decoration:none;\"">hairsolutions.co</a></p>\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"">\n          <a href=\""{{ unsubscribe_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Unsubscribe</a> &bull;\n          <a href=\""{{ subscription_preferences_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Manage preferences</a>\n        </p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>"",""schema_version"":2}",07d5a9fa4967bf30671540bb609210a8332a266c582c3283b659293a22ed107c,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214989747033_module_1_0_0_1,214989747033,J4-E3 — Loyalty Hook,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214989747036_module_0_0_0_0,214989747036,J2-E2 — How Systems Work,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<table width=\""100%\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;\"">\n  <tr><td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding:32px 16px;\"">\n    <table width=\""580\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""max-width:580px;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\"">\n\n      <!-- HEADER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#1a1a1a;padding:28px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <span style=\""color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;\"">Hair Solutions Co.</span>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- BODY -->\n      <tr><td style=\""padding:40px;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"">\n        <h2 style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;margin:0 0 20px;color:#1a1a1a;\"">Hi {{ contact.firstname | default(\""there\"") }},</h2>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">If you’re newer to hair replacement systems, here’s a quick rundown of how it all works.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">A system is a custom base — made from materials like lace, polyurethane (poly), or a combination — onto which human hair is hand-tied to match your natural color, density, and growth pattern.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">It’s attached to your scalp using adhesive or tape, sitting over the area where hair has thinned, and blends with your existing hair around it.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">With proper care, a quality system can last several months before needing replacement, and most people find the day-to-day routine becomes second nature within a couple of weeks.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">&mdash; The Hair Solutions Co. Team</p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- FOOTER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.5;\"">Hair Solutions Co. &bull; <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co\"" style=\""color:#999999;text-decoration:none;\"">hairsolutions.co</a></p>\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"">\n          <a href=\""{{ unsubscribe_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Unsubscribe</a> &bull;\n          <a href=\""{{ subscription_preferences_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Manage preferences</a>\n        </p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>"",""schema_version"":2}",62f61413db380fc1c4e7d1bb1a31d5cfcea3c7edb01b529e5b593746f077a9dc,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214989747036_module_1_0_0_1,214989747036,J2-E2 — How Systems Work,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214989747039_module_0_0_0_0,214989747039,J6-E1 — Loyalty Acknowledgment,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<table width=\""100%\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;\"">\n  <tr><td align=\""center\"" style=\""padding:32px 16px;\"">\n    <table width=\""580\"" cellpadding=\""0\"" cellspacing=\""0\"" border=\""0\"" style=\""max-width:580px;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\"">\n\n      <!-- HEADER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#1a1a1a;padding:28px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <span style=\""color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;\"">Hair Solutions Co.</span>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- BODY -->\n      <tr><td style=\""padding:40px;color:#1a1a1a;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"">\n        <h2 style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;margin:0 0 20px;color:#1a1a1a;\"">Hi {{ contact.firstname | default(\""there\"") }},</h2>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">We just wanted to take a moment to say thank you.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">You’ve been with us for a while now, and that means a lot — especially in a business built so much on trust and personal recommendations.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">Clients like you are a big part of why Hair Solutions Co. has grown the way it has, whether through repeat orders, referrals, or simply sticking with us.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">We don’t take that for granted, and we’re always working to make sure it stays worth it.</p>\n<p style=\""font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 18px;color:#333333;\"">&mdash; Vincent<br>Hair Solutions Co.</p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- FOOTER -->\n      <tr><td style=\""background-color:#f9f7f4;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;\"">\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.5;\"">Hair Solutions Co. &bull; <a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co\"" style=\""color:#999999;text-decoration:none;\"">hairsolutions.co</a></p>\n        <p style=\""font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#999999;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\"">\n          <a href=\""{{ unsubscribe_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Unsubscribe</a> &bull;\n          <a href=\""{{ subscription_preferences_link }}\"" style=\""color:#999999;\"">Manage preferences</a>\n        </p>\n      </td></tr>\n\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>"",""schema_version"":2}",2431d88c89f3971e9dd1c2c903bc4815af431927d780ae128d066ad5143c6e63,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214989747039_module_1_0_0_1,214989747039,J6-E1 — Loyalty Acknowledgment,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_email_footer,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/email_footer,2869621,module-1-0-0,module-1-0-0,module,3,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""align"":""center"",""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""schema_version"":2,""unsubscribe_link_type"":""both""}",65f51654842a159a280c79991bdb93885f67a22e4d72fba65d1b065e04027944,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214990233219_module_0_0_0_0,214990233219,WF-Welcome-02-Education-Hook,AUTOMATED,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/dnd/plain_text.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,1155639,module-0-0-0,module-0-0-0,module,2,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""html"":""<p>Hi {{ personalization_token(\""contact.firstname\"", \""there\"") }},</p>\n\n<p>One of the most common questions we hear from people exploring hair systems for the first time is: <strong>\""Which base type is right for me?\""</strong></p>\n\n<p>Here's a quick breakdown to help you decide:</p>\n\n<p><strong>🔹 Lace Base</strong><br>\nThe most natural-looking option. The fine mesh creates an invisible hairline that blends seamlessly with your skin. Best for: front hairline visibility, natural appearance priority.</p>\n\n<p><strong>🔹 Poly (Polyurethane) Base</strong><br>\nDurable and easy to maintain. A thin, transparent layer that's simple to attach and clean. Best for: longevity, easy maintenance, active lifestyles.</p>\n\n<p><strong>🔹 Hybrid/Mono Base</strong><br>\nCombines the best of both worlds — lace front for a natural hairline with a poly or mono back for durability. Best for: balanced appearance and durability.</p>\n\n<p>Not sure which is right for you? We've put together a detailed comparison guide that walks you through the pros and cons of each option.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\""https://hairsolutions.co/pages/base-finder?utm_source=hubspot&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=welcome-flow&utm_content=wf-welcome-02&utm_term=hero-cta\"" style=\""background-color:#1a1a2e;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 24px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;font-weight:bold;\"">Take the Base Finder Quiz →</a></p>\n\n<p>Talk soon,<br>\nVincent Laroche<br>\nFounder, Hair Solutions Co.</p>"",""schema_version"":2}",944f9c1f37af701777e5da1a40affe5f5ca2b2853ffc8d6f3648d1a7e9908bec,True,False,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
