usage_214990267399_module_0_0_0_0,214990267399,CP W10 — Customer Story,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_image_email,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/image_email,,module-0-0-0,,,,section-0,0,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""16px"",""padding-left"":""40px"",""padding-right"":""40px"",""padding-top"":""40px""},""img"":{""alt"":""Hair Solutions Co. logo"",""height"":85,""loading"":""disabled"",""src"":""https://res.cloudinary.com/dtmizxj1n/image/upload/v1771059055/_HAIR_SOLUTIONS_CO_/01_SHARED/brand/logos/hairsolutions-logo-rectangular-white-transparent-1200x700.png"",""width"":220},""lineNumber"":61,""link"":""https://hairsolutions.co"",""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-1015}",8ea6647c1af0a165b19aaf5ecbd3d98d540c3520a263719b8776430918ee1cd2,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214990267399_module_1_0_0_1,214990267399,CP W10 — Customer Story,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,,module-1-0-0,,,,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""28px"",""padding-left"":""40px"",""padding-right"":""40px"",""padding-top"":""16px""},""html"":""<div style=\""font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:150%;color:#FFFFFF;\""><h1 style=\""margin:0;font-family:Arial Black,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:52px;line-height:108%;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.3px;text-align:center;color:#FFFFFF;\"">A STORY WORTH SHARING.</h1><p style=\""margin:16px 0 0 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;text-align:center;color:#FFFFFF;\"">A real transformation — in his own words.</p></div>"",""lineNumber"":94,""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-442}",580122e91aa3d076d4d6e8088d5f570d35a26f60aa678e70774ebcb14018c2ae,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214990267399_module_2_0_0_2,214990267399,CP W10 — Customer Story,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_image_email,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/image_email,,module-2-0-0,,,,section-2,2,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""20px"",""padding-left"":""20px"",""padding-right"":""20px"",""padding-top"":""20px""},""img"":{""alt"":""Customer hair system transformation testimonial showing before and after results"",""height"":320,""loading"":""disabled"",""src"":""https://res.cloudinary.com/dtmizxj1n/image/upload/w_600,h_270,c_fill,g_auto,q_auto,f_auto/v1/Salem_hair_system_transformation_testimonial"",""width"":560},""lineNumber"":61,""link"":""https://hairsolutions.co/pages/testimonials"",""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-1015}",86f81422c052eb308da939f9bb244c49744a73df40c82c053d546a2c0c527b1b,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214990267399_module_3_0_0_3,214990267399,CP W10 — Customer Story,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,,module-3-0-0,,,,section-3,3,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""20px"",""padding-left"":""40px"",""padding-right"":""40px"",""padding-top"":""16px""},""html"":""<div style=\""font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:150%;color:#1A1A1A;\""><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\"">We talk a lot about what our systems can do. Today, we're letting someone else do the talking. Meet Danny — a 34-year-old project manager from Austin who started losing his hair at 26 and spent years trying everything before finding Hair Solutions Co.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>\""I tried it all.\""</strong> Danny's story will sound familiar to a lot of you. Minoxidil for three years with minimal results. Expensive PRP treatments that promised the world. Hats that became a permanent accessory. \""I stopped going to pool parties. I avoided photos. I was 30 years old and living like I had something to hide,\"" Danny told us. \""The worst part wasn't the hair loss itself — it was how much mental space it took up. I was thinking about it constantly.\""</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>The turning point.</strong> Danny discovered hair systems through a YouTube video and spent months researching before pulling the trigger. \""I was skeptical. I thought it would look fake, or that people would notice. I ordered my first system from Hair Solutions Co. and when I put it on — I just stared in the mirror. I looked like me again. The version of me I'd been missing.\"" His first system was a French lace unit in a natural dark brown with a medium density.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>Life after the switch.</strong> Eight months later, Danny hasn't looked back. \""My girlfriend didn't know for the first three months. When I finally told her, she couldn't believe it. My coworkers have no idea. I went from avoiding the camera to taking selfies.\"" He works out five days a week, swims on weekends, and travels for work — all without a second thought about his system. \""It just works. That's the best thing I can say about it. It just works, and I get to live my life again.\""</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>Your story is next.</strong> Danny's experience isn't unique — it's the experience we hear from customers every single week. The only difference between where you are now and where Danny is? One decision. We're here when you're ready to make it.</p></div>"",""lineNumber"":94,""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-442}",e10effd8c158c77dc70a6be2bf6251a8ae21992cff1a6bfc241ee86ed90ebde3,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
