usage_214990267402_module_1_0_0_1,214990267402,CP W12 — Reengagement Push,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,,module-1-0-0,,,,section-1,1,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""28px"",""padding-left"":""40px"",""padding-right"":""40px"",""padding-top"":""16px""},""html"":""<div style=\""font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:150%;color:#FFFFFF;\""><h1 style=\""margin:0;font-family:Arial Black,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:52px;line-height:108%;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.3px;text-align:center;color:#FFFFFF;\"">WE'VE MISSED YOU.</h1><p style=\""margin:16px 0 0 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;text-align:center;color:#FFFFFF;\"">New systems, better tools, same mission — come see.</p></div>"",""lineNumber"":94,""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-442}",1ba4f9ee0766d955ffdb06bdc3c92c6ef4c8572e7c5979c4eee80369f0cf4307,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214990267402_module_2_0_0_2,214990267402,CP W12 — Reengagement Push,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_image_email,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/image_email,,module-2-0-0,,,,section-2,2,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""20px"",""padding-left"":""20px"",""padding-right"":""20px"",""padding-top"":""20px""},""img"":{""alt"":""Confident man strolling through city streets wearing a hair system"",""height"":320,""loading"":""disabled"",""src"":""https://res.cloudinary.com/dtmizxj1n/image/upload/w_600,q_auto,f_auto/v1/Confident_Stroll_Through_City_Streets"",""width"":560},""lineNumber"":61,""link"":""https://hairsolutions.co/collections/new-arrivals"",""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-1015}",c76c8da69ae6f637f20833431b099be4883305786da6910894af49b79158c00f,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
usage_214990267402_module_3_0_0_3,214990267402,CP W12 — Reengagement Push,AUTOMATED_DRAFT,AUTOMATED_EMAIL,all_emails_recheck.json,,snapshot,draft_snapshot_if_source_was_draft_else_export_snapshot,@hubspot/email/ecommerce/ecommerce_abandoned_cart_4.html,builtin_hubspot_rich_text,builtin_hubspot,HubSpot built-in modules,@hubspot/rich_text,,module-3-0-0,,,,section-3,3,0,0,,"{""css_class"":""dnd-module"",""hs_enable_module_padding"":true,""hs_wrapper_css"":{""padding-bottom"":""20px"",""padding-left"":""40px"",""padding-right"":""40px"",""padding-top"":""16px""},""html"":""<div style=\""font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:150%;color:#1A1A1A;\""><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\"">It's been a while since we've seen you, and we wanted to check in. Life gets busy — we get it. But while you've been away, we've been building. And there's a lot worth coming back for.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>New systems, new options.</strong> We've expanded our collection significantly since your last visit. New base constructions, more color options, additional density levels, and improved hair quality across the board. Whether you were browsing last time or you're a past customer ready for a refresh, the selection today is the strongest it's ever been. Systems that didn't exist three months ago might be exactly what you've been looking for.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>Better tools, better experience.</strong> We've upgraded our care and maintenance lineup too. Stronger adhesives with longer hold times. Gentler removers that protect your base. System-safe hair products formulated to extend the life of every unit. If maintenance was ever a concern, the products available now make the routine simpler and more effective than ever.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>The same mission.</strong> What hasn't changed is why we do this. Hair Solutions Co. exists to give men a path back to confidence — without surgery, without drugs, without waiting and hoping. Just proven, undetectable hair systems that let you look and feel like yourself again. That mission hasn't wavered, and it never will.</p><p style=\""margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:150%;font-weight:400;color:#1A1A1A;\""><strong>Come take another look.</strong> No pressure, no hard sell. Just an invitation to see what's new and decide if now is the right time. Your next chapter of confidence is one click away — and we'll be here whenever you're ready.</p></div>"",""lineNumber"":94,""parent_widget_container"":null,""schema_version"":2,""startPosition"":-442}",ece4c8acc02bd97e3211fbc5baf27a55fd326150727c2aee5e9eebc7162db024,False,True,2026-07-03,observed_in_hubspot_json,legacy_builtin_or_native_hubspot_module,
